1. HTML5 ke Features aur Unka Use:
HTML5 Feature	Project me kahan aur kyun use hua?
Semantic Layout Elements (<header>, <nav>, <section>, <main>, <canvas>)	Page ko clean, accessible aur SEO-friendly banane ke liye. <div> ki bheed ke badle meaningful structure diya gaya.
HTML5 Canvas 2D API (<canvas id="leavesCanvas">)	Background me girte hue natural patton (falling leaves) ko hardware-accelerated 60fps render karne ke liye.
Inline Vector Graphics (SVG) (<svg>, <path>)	Leaf logo, sailboats, aur user icons ke liye. Isse mojibake/corrupt text (ðŸ) ka risk 0% ho gaya aur sabhi screen sizes par icons bina phate crystal-clear sharp dikhte hain.
Advanced Form Input Attributes (type="date", min, required, placeholder)	Leave duration pickers me calendar kholne aur validation ensure karne ke liye.
Viewport Meta Tag (<meta name="viewport" ...>)	Page ko mobile, tablet aur desktop sabhi devices par automatically adapt (responsive) karne ke liye.
Modal Dialog Containers (<div class="modal-backdrop">)	"Overview" aur "About" popups ko screen ke center me blur background ke sath show karne ke liye.

2. CSS3 ke Features aur Unka Use:
CSS3 Feature	Project me kahan aur kyun use hua?
CSS Custom Properties (Variables) (:root { --primary-teal, --glass-marine-bg, ... })	Poore project ka theme ek jagah se control karne ke liye. Colors, border-radii aur animation timings ko maintain karna aasan banaya.
Glassmorphism & Backdrop Filter (backdrop-filter: blur(24px), -webkit-backdrop-filter)	Deep oceanic frosted glass effect banane ke liye taki peeche ki coastal scenery subtle tarike se jhalakti rahe aur cards "fika-fika" na lagein.
Complex Gradients (linear-gradient, radial-gradient)	Sun-glow, ocean sparkles, background overlay, jewel-toned marine cards, aur buttons me rich depth laane ke liye.
CSS3 Keyframe Animations (@keyframes)	• scenicBreathe: Background image ko gentle breathing motion deta hai.
• cloudDrift: Badal ko aasman me slow drift karata hai.
• flapLeft / flapRight: Seagull pakshiyon ke pankh hilata hai.
• sunPulse: Suraj ke glow ko dhimi dhimi roshni me chamkata hai.
Cubic-Bezier Easing (cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1))	Options par click karne par abrupt jhatka na lage, balki ek luxury slow aur smooth cinematic opening transition mile.
CSS Flexbox & CSS Grid (display: grid, display: flex)	Two-column responsive dashboard layout, KPI stat cards grid, aur header navigation ko cleanly align karne ke liye.
Pseudo-elements (::before, ::after)	Card ke top par colorful iridescent strip banane aur custom select dropdown arrows render karne ke liye.
Media Queries (@media (max-width: 768px))	Mobile screens par automatic single-column layout switch karne ke liye.
3. JavaScript (ES6+) ke Features aur Unka Use:
JavaScript Feature	Project me kahan aur kyun use hua?
Canvas 2D Particle Engine (requestAnimationFrame, bezierCurveTo)	Math trigonometric functions (Math.sin(), Math.random()) use karke natural hawa ke bahav me lehrate hue leaves particles simulate kiye.
ES6 Modern Syntax (const/let, Arrow Functions () => {}, Template Literals `...`)	Clean, readable aur fast execution code ke liye.
Array Higher-Order Methods (.filter(), .map(), .reduce(), .some())	• .filter(): Pending/Approved/Rejected leaves filter karne me.
• .some(): Leave validation me date overlap aur keyword sentiment search me.
• .reduce(): Average AI confidence score calculate karne me.
Web Storage API (LocalStorage) (localStorage.setItem, getItem)	User login state, leaves data, aur audit trail ko browser me permanently save rakhne ke liye bina kisi external database ke.
Date Object API (new Date(), .toLocaleTimeString())	Real-time live digital clock chalane aur Leave duration (days count) accurately compute karne ke liye.
Regular Expressions (RegExp) (/^[A-Za-z0-9\s.,'!?()\-]+$/)	Security validation ke liye taki script injection ruke aur employee normal English sentences, dates aur punctuation bina kisi error ke type kar sake.
Multi-Agent AI Simulation Logic:	1. Leave Validation Agent: Policy compliance, duration check, keyword match aur confidence score calculate karta hai.
2. Approval Recommendation Agent: Weighted decision matrix se Human-in-the-Loop suggestion (Approve/Review/Reject) nikalta hai.
3. Analytics Agent: Charts aur KPI statistical distribution generate karta hai.
Audit Ledger Logging (logAudit())	Immutable chronological timeline maintain karta hai jisme har action (who, when, what) log hoti hai.
